From b51e108618a47e27648e98265d5b1353ff15ad0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <a@b>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:33:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 26/27] arm64: dts: qcom: sda660-xiaomi-clover: enable CPU DVFS
 (speed bin 1)

Fold the bin-1 CPU DVFS into the DTB postmarketOS actually installs and
drop the four per-bin test DTBs. clover's fuses read speed bin 1 (logged
by the CPR3 driver); bins 0/3/4 tables stay in the tree for other units.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile                        | 4 ----
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin0.dts  | 9 ---------
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin1.dts  | 9 ---------
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin3.dts  | 9 ---------
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin4.dts  | 9 ---------
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover.dts        | 4 ++++
 6 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin0.dts
 delete mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin1.dts
 delete mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin3.dts
 delete mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sda660-xiaomi-clover-cpufreq-bin4.dts

